WEBVTT

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.270
Wait, Kai!

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.740
Farewell, Gerda. I'm going.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.550
Going where?

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.040
Kai!

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.290
The Snow Queen...

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:01.600
Gerda and the Snow Queen

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:04.890
Are you okay?

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:06.170
I'm fine—

00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:12.400
At this rate, we'll freeze to death 
before we find the Chaos Teller.

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:13.900
Freeze to death...

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:17.610
What? You think of a good joke 
about freezing to death?

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:21.130
No, I don't think it's a joke...

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:25.410
But it is right in front of us.

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:26.660
Oh, no!

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.010
Wake up!

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:31.670
Can you hear me?

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:33.170
Kai...

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:34.300
Kai?

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.520
That's not good.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:37.020
She's only half conscious.

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:39.370
There must be somewhere 
we can get out of the wind...

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:42.090
Look.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:46.970
Yes?

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.310
Sorry to bother you!

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.400
We're travelers, and we found 
this girl lying on the ground...

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:54.280
I can't see,

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:56.070
but I can tell by your voices...

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:57.820
You're telling the truth.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.030
You're...

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.410
It's but a small house, but do come in.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:08.480
Well?

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:10.230
Her breathing's evened out.

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:11.830
I think she'll be okay, but...

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:17.300
Can you hear me?

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:20.840
A-Are you robbers?

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:23.720
Oh, I'm sorry...

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:28.110
It's just that I met a lot 
of people on my way here,

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:29.850
including robbers and an old witch.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.350
What?

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.350
Could you tell us more?

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:37.650
Kai and I live in a village far to the south.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:40.840
We've been like brother and sister 
ever since we were little.

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:46.290
But one day...

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:51.790
A shard of a cursed mirror 
got stuck in his eye.

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:56.730
After that, he became cold and distant.

00:03:57.810 --> 00:04:03.660
Then one snowy day, he was
 taken away by the Snow Queen.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:07.080
I want Kai back, no matter what.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:13.020
That's why I was looking for the icy palace
where the Snow Queen is said to live...

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:15.650
And then you collapsed.

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:16.770
Yes.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:20.730
So this is the Snow Queen's Story Zone, I guess?

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:26.280
Everyone, why don't we eat now
and save the talking for later?

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:28.210
Yes! That sounds wonderful!

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.670
This stew is so great!

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:40.500
Well, you like everything, but...

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.550
Thank you!

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:48.480
My friend makes me food 
and does the shopping for!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.260
You two are amazing...

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:54.600
So, you're all travelers, you said?

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:57.550
Yeah. We've been all over the place.

00:04:57.550 --> 00:05:01.070
Wow, you must have wonderful Books of Fate!

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:03.780
Y-Yeah...

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:08.530
And have you ever run into 
anything unusual in your travels?

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.700
Yeah, plenty of times.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:14.440
Perhaps a secret treasure?

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:16.040
We've seen that, too!

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:18.160
But, man, that one was rough...

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:20.270
Are you still not feeling well?

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:22.590
I need to go find Kai...

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:25.130
You're not going anywhere 
on an empty stomach.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:28.370
If you don't get some energy, 
you'll freeze out there again.

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:29.880
That's right.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:35.520
You'll need to go through a forest of 
deep snow to reach the Snow Queen's palace.

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:39.400
You know where her palace is?

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:42.540
Everyone around here knows where it is.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:46.740
And they say whoever 
gets close to it is frozen alive.

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:49.960
But I still have to go.

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:50.890
Don't worry.

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:52.810
We'll go with you.

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:54.010
Miss Shane...

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:56.120
Just call me Shane.

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:00.540
Then call me Gerda.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.780
Take care, everyone!

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:08.130
Thank you.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:10.050
Your stew really was delicious!

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:13.600
Ex.

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:17.260
Sometimes fate can be cruel.

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:20.650
No matter what happens next,

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:22.230
don't give up.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:25.430
Th-Thank you.

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:31.950
Gerda, you said Kai 
was like a brother to you?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:32.940
Yeah.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:37.200
He was so kind, so cool... 
You could always count on him.

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:40.140
He was like a real brother to me.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:43.210
A brother, huh? I see...

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.170
That girl in the cabin...

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:47.710
We never got her name.

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:48.950
That's it.

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:51.050
How did she know my name?

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:54.120
Somebody said it, maybe?

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.270
What's that?

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:02.090
We're nearing the Snow Queen's palace.

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:03.820
Then this blizzard...

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:08.420
With powerful enough magic,
 you can even control the weather.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.070
This is getting fun.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.640
I'm here for you.

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:17.440
Let's do this.

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:19.330
Thank you, Shane.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:23.840
Was Shane really the type to open up 
like that to somebody she's just met?

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:24.990
You're right...

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:27.950
It's kind of rare for her to act this way.

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:29.090
Who knows?

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:32.410
There's probably some reason for it.

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:35.610
Like brother and sister, huh?

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:39.730
<i>You find the same stories everywhere, huh?</i>

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.100
The blizzard...

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:45.590
Look!

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:53.680
The Tao family has arrived 
at the Snow Queen's palace.

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:56.680
That "Tao family" stuff aside...

00:07:57.360 --> 00:08:00.000
It looks like it's made entirely of ice.

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:04.830
Gerda, I told you not to come.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:05.610
Kai!

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:06.340
That's him?

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:10.050
Please, Kai! Come back to the village with me.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.080
I can't.

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:11.840
Why?

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:14.780
I'm just following my Book of Fate.

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:17.090
It says I'm to go with the Snow Queen

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:18.760
and leave you.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:23.390
Then I'll do what my Book of Fate
 says and bring you back!

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:27.120
I've already made a contract 
with the Snow Queen.

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:30.890
It says that I have to stay here forever.

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:31.990
No...

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:34.490
Please... Leave, Gerda.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:37.640
You have no idea what
 she went through to get here.

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:40.040
You're being pretty selfish.

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:42.020
This doesn't concern you.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.500
Leave forthwith.

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:45.840
Not happening.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:46.890
That's right...

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:49.880
That's not happening.

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:50.990
Tell me, Kai.

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:54.420
As long as someone fulfills the contract, 
you can come back, right?

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:57.100
So can she stay here instead?

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:01.280
Shane!

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:03.780
Stay away.

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:08.690
Hey, what the hell did you do to my sister?!

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:12.070
I may not look like it, 
but I know how to use magic.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:15.200
Those eyes...

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:17.520
So that's it.

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:22.790
A shard of the cursed mirror 
actually struck Gerda!

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:26.420
That can't be! Gerda came to look for Kai!

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:30.500
Just like she said, 
she was following her Book of Fate.

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:35.260
She probably doesn't even know 
why she wants to save Kai.

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:38.660
I wondered why she was 
always so expressionless...

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.300
So that's it.

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:41.480
Look, Kai.

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:42.810
I have someone to take your place.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.710
So come with me.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:45.930
Gerda...

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:49.400
That's why... That's why I told you to leave.

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:52.350
You're not who you used to be.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:54.630
You're just following your Book of Fate.

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:56.570
Enough, Kai.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:01.360
Our guests have caused something 
unexpected to happen.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:03.460
I'll put a stop to this here.

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:04.490
This voice!

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:07.170
Wait, Snow Queen!

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:09.960
What the...?!

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:29.850
Connect!

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:40.950
That was close.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:44.700
I think the others are probably nearby...

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:47.320
Are you hurt, Gerda?

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.960
Why did you save me?

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:54.120
Is that your fate? I don't understand.

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:55.910
I don't understand anything.

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:58.060
Fate has nothing to do with it.

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:01.960
I wanted to save you.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:04.260
That's all there is to it.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:09.170
And I think you're...

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.020
There you are, Shane!

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:13.480
Brother Tao!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.370
What have I done?

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:22.160
I don't understand... 
It's like there's a fog in my head.

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:24.530
She's been like this for a while.

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:29.480
Her original feelings, which had been 
sealed away, are coming back to her.

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:32.080
That's what's causing the temporary confusion.

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:35.640
I don't understand anything anymore...

00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:38.000
My memories are fading away...

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:39.800
My happy memories with Kai.

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:42.300
It's better not to force yourself to remember.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.430
I understand your situation,

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:48.270
but you put my sister in danger.

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:50.310
You're going to have to pay for that.

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:51.350
Tao!

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:54.520
I was the one who saved her.

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:59.580
If you want somebody to pay, 
you should ask me first!

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:02.210
Good grief... I get it already.

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:05.540
If you insist, I'll let it go.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:09.450
You're such a bratty little sister, though.

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:11.240
Shane...

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:12.880
About what I said before...

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:16.770
I think it's just that I didn't 
want to see you suffer.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:21.550
The whole "brother and sister" thing 
is pretty important to me, too.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:24.830
Thank you, Shane.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:29.100
But I don't even know how 
I'm supposed to react...

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:32.600
Don't worry, Gerda.

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:36.770
What's wrong, Tao?

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:39.280
There's a draft coming in through here.

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:41.190
If we widen the hole, we can escape.

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:43.950
A tunnel of ice...

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.320
Looks like this is the only way we can go.

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:54.520
My memories of Kai are getting 
further and further away.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:57.420
Are they fun memories?

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:58.960
I don't even know...

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:04.430
It's like I'm losing the ability 
to feel happy or sad...

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:08.720
All that's left is the desire 
not to be alone—to get Kai back.

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:12.470
I used to be alone, too.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:16.980
I didn't really understand what 
it meant to be happy or sad.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:21.450
But one day, I found a brother 
who was always very cheerful,

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:25.530
and all sorts of feelings 
started to bloom inside me.

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:28.030
All sorts of feelings, huh?

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:32.660
I'm sure that Kai knows 
all the feelings you've forgotten.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:35.790
So let's go get him back!

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:38.760
Sheesh...

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:42.080
My sister's such a softie.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.630
Don't you guys think so—

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:46.970
Shane...

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:49.680
You love Tao so much!

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:55.720
I-If you keep crying like that, 
your snot and tears will freeze.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:04.190
This place is huge.

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:08.450
Looks like we're right below the palace.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:09.610
That's right.

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:15.250
You've already set foot on 
the Snow Queen's sacred grounds.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:16.160
Kai!

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:19.960
Kai, Gerda needs you!

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.490
Can't you go home with her?

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:24.780
No. I can't go back.

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:26.310
And I don't intend to.

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:30.140
I'm going to stay here and fulfill 
my contract with the Snow Queen.

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:32.740
I see. Your contract, huh?

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:35.730
I'm a brother too, so I get it.

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:40.650
Your sister took the curse 
that was supposed to fall on you.

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:43.190
It's gotta be bugging you.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:46.030
So tell us what that contract really says!

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:50.570
It's the only thing I could do.

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:51.910
What do you mean?

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:56.840
I am to stay with the Snow Queen 
forever in this palace of ice.

00:14:56.840 --> 00:15:01.570
And if I do, she says she'll take the shard
 of the cursed mirror out of Gerda's eye

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:03.670
and return her to normal.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.850
So I...

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:13.140
I'm sorry, Kai.

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:14.850
Gerda...

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:18.350
I've made you suffer for so long, haven't I?

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:21.980
It's my fault you...

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:28.360
Why? I thought I lost my 
feelings a long time ago...

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:30.220
Do you understand now?

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:34.320
It's not the Snow Queen who'll 
remove the curse from Gerda.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.950
It's you, Kai.

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:41.540
Why don't you actually talk to Gerda?

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:46.800
Her memories of you are what's kept her going.

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:53.490
Gerda, do you remember...

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:56.370
the roses we grew together?

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:59.060
Roses?

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:02.530
I've never forgotten them.

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:11.970
Or the way you watered 
them as best you could

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:13.520
while singing hymns.

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:19.660
I remember... I remember, Kai.

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:22.790
I won't run from you anymore.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.560
So you remember 
the feelings you've forgotten,

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:27.160
I'll stay with you forever.

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:28.550
Kai...

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:34.740
Gerda...

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:36.820
We'll never be apart again.

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:38.180
We'll be together forever.

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:41.140
This is so, so very strange...

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:44.000
I can't stop crying...

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:46.860
Even though I'm right next to you!

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:48.860
It's because you're happy.

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:51.290
This is... happiness?

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:55.980
What?

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:58.030
That was the shard of the cursed mirror!

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:00.740
I...

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:02.620
That's wonderful, Gerda!

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:05.710
Kai! I'm so happy!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:09.380
So much happiness is 
welling up within my heart.

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:10.970
I see.

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:13.800
So you <i>can</i> smile like that, huh?

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:17.870
I'm sorry for what I did to you, Shane...

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:19.810
There's no need to apologize.

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:23.980
Instead, give me a big smile and a thank you!

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:26.310
That's all I want in return.

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:27.880
Okay!

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:29.480
Thank you, Shane!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:30.860
Thank you so much!

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:35.430
Ridiculous.

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:39.450
A smile?

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:44.330
I'll freeze your smile with my ice!

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.850
That's the Snow Queen?

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:51.630
So she was the Chaos Teller!

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:54.050
I won't let you have Kai.

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:59.130
He has the purest heart in this world.

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:02.930
That's why he must be sealed away forever!

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:04.270
What?!

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:07.230
The way you struggle for the one you love...

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:10.090
Your sadness, your sorrow, your rage...

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:12.150
It's so beautiful!

00:18:12.390 --> 00:18:17.530
So, basically, you did this to Gerda 
so that you could watch Kai suffer?

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:18.780
Indeed.

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:21.120
You piece of crap!

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.160
I'll make you regret this.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:25.480
Get back, you two.

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:27.710
But the Snow Queen's magic...

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:29.330
It's crap.

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:30.590
Let's do this.

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:31.840
Right, Shane.

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:32.840
Snow White!

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:35.790
Dulcinea!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.520
Don Quixote!

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:39.480
Queen of the Poison Apple!

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:41.300
Connect!

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:51.820
Mirror, mirror, on the wall, 
who is the fairest of them all?

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:53.980
Fools!

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:58.990
My magic shall make you 
part of my ice palace!

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.740
I-It's so cold!

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:04.120
I love the sound of your screams!

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:06.040
Her power is incredible!

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:10.830
Now I'll pierce your heart... and freeze it!

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:15.620
Daydream for a Knight!

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:25.930
Did you think a technique 
like that would work on me?

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:26.930
No!

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:29.350
But a moment is all we needed!

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:31.450
That's right.

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:36.870
Begone! Final Apple Fatale!

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:47.360
Did you enjoy the taste of my poison apple?

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:57.500
Reina, the tuning.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:58.250
Right.

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:01.080
You!

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:02.470
What are you doing here?

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:04.540
We meet again.

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:08.890
Did you enjoy the Chaos Teller I created?

00:20:09.110 --> 00:20:10.420
Created?

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:12.230
What are you talking about?

00:20:12.470 --> 00:20:16.020
Do you really intend to do the tuning?

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:17.570
She even knows about that?

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:21.740
The Snow Queen spent an eternity alone

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:24.950
in a dark, freezing palace.

00:20:25.150 --> 00:20:27.780
And you're saying that's 
why she kidnapped Kai?

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:29.730
My, how scary...

00:20:30.260 --> 00:20:33.790
I simply listened to the voice within her.

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:36.000
You listened... to a voice?

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:41.630
Poor Captain Silver ends his life 
without ever achieving his dream.

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:47.150
When the wolf eats Red Riding Hood, 
she screams and cries in fear.

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:48.470
She even knows about them?

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:53.980
The one way to escape the cruel fates
 penned by the Storyteller...

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.270
It's Chaos Tellers.

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.020
No, you're wrong!

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.440
Do you really think so?

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:03.700
Lady Curly.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:06.820
You mustn't come out here alone.

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:07.820
Loki!

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:12.120
I'm sorry. I just wanted to see them all.

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:13.750
Who are you?

00:21:14.010 --> 00:21:15.830
My name is Curly.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:17.330
I'll be seeing you again.

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:19.710
Now, let's go.

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:22.840
You have your duties 
as the Priestess of Chaos.

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:24.260
Wait, Loki!

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:30.310
I never imagined she was working with Loki.

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:38.710
It turned into a mess at the end, 
but Gerda, this is goodbye.

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:40.270
Thank you, Shane!

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:43.650
I'll never forget you!

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:49.780
Return this story to its proper form...

00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:55.940
Teller of tales, 
drowned in a maelstrom of chaos...

00:21:55.940 --> 00:22:00.040
By my words, I now begin the tuning...

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:15.580
This road will take us back home.

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:17.980
What's wrong?

00:22:18.320 --> 00:22:21.470
Did I get to say thank you, I wonder?

00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:23.910
Thank you to who?

00:22:24.640 --> 00:22:26.920
It's nothing.

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:28.660
Let's go, Kai!
